WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,100
Why is there water in the car?

2
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:09,850
There is still a lot of water

3
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,890
Because there is a water artist in my team

4
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,330
There will be no shortage of water for the time being

5
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:21,620
This water can only be used for washing now and cannot be drank directly. If it is boiled, it should be drinkable.

6
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:29,630
Just said it

7
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:34,410
Next door is the kitchen

8
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,930
I'm sorry to trouble you about today's dinner.

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,720
There's even a kitchen on this dam. It's awesome, big boss.

10
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,280
You have really talented people

11
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:47,660
Next door is a warehouse

12
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,100
The ingredients are up to you.

13
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,500
Use whatever is in the refrigerator

14
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,140
It could be dangerous tonight

15
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,660
You can stay one night

16
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,370
Thank you so much

17
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,780
You can choose any bed
